= [Interpreter]Table
 * Arguments
  1. format - required. `tsv` or `csv`.
  1. row header count - optional.
  1. column header count - optional.

Most of spreadsheet applications use `tsv` format for clipboard.

[[[#!WikiSyntaxPreview Table tsv
a	b	c	d
e	f	g	h
i	j	k	l
m	n	o	p
]]]

